==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Cheap Labor}}

==Battleground==
*1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Ackey]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take advantage of the Colosseum's rules to deploy otherwise expensive units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or other Mythics like [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs & Minka]] for a cheap price. This stage consists of mostly Dark/Aku enemies, however the only dangerous pushers are the Midnite D. and Ragin' Gory, which both spawn twice. Once they are dealt with with many possible units like [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], using good timings on [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] and another meatshields that aren't too impacted by the restriction, you can keep the slow attacking enemies at bay. Keep track of your money so as to not run out, and use any meatshields sparingly. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] with Money UP [[Talents]] can be used at the start to deal with Shadow Boxer Ks.

